he reCAPTCHA to continue.</p></div>\n    <p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden>Sorry, something went wrong. Please call 020 4634 2518 or email info@whizzit.co.uk.</p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"callback__success\" id=\"callback-success\" tabindex=\"-1\" hidden>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"m8.5 12 2.5 2.5 4.5-5\"/></svg>\n    <p><strong>{{s100}}</strong> {{s101}} <a href=\"{{u102}}\" data-track=\"sector-construction-talk-success-phone\">{{s103}}</a></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n      <a class=\"sx-talk__call\" href=\"{{u104}}\" data-track=\"sector-construction-talk-phone\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z\"/></svg><span>{{s105}} <strong>{{s106}}</strong></span></a>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</div>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"01"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Built for construction"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Technology construction teams can rely on"},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Construction and engineering teams work across offices, sites and the road, relying on drawings, project files and collaboration tools being available wherever they are."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"WhizzIT keeps your sites connected, your project data protected and your people supported, so technology never holds up the programme."},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"02"},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 6","default":"What you get with WhizzIT"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Heading 2","default":"What you get with WhizzIT"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"01"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Connectivity and support across offices and sites"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"02"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Protected project data and drawings"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"03"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Secure mobile and remote working"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 7","default":"04"},{"k":"s15","type":"s","label":"List item 8","default":"Backup and disaster recovery procedures"},{"k":"s16","type":"s","label":"List item 9","default":"05"},{"k":"s17","type":"s","label":"List item 10","default":"Cyber security protection from online threats"},{"k":"s18","type":"s","label":"List item 11","default":"06"},{"k":"s19","type":"s","label":"List item 12","default":"Less downtime, faster resolution, greater productivity"},{"k":"s20","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 7","default":"03"},{"k":"s21","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 8","default":"Construction and the built environment"},{"k":"s22","type":"s","label":"Heading 3","default":"The office is fixed, the sites are not"},{"k":"s23","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 9","default":"Construction IT has to work in two places at once: a settled head office and a rotating set of sites that exist for months, have no fixed infrastructure and are frequently outside reliable coverage. Very little standard office IT design survives contact with that."},{"k":"s24","type":"s","label":"List item 13","default":"01"},{"k":"s25","type":"s","label":"Heading 4","default":"Connectivity on a site that has none"},{"k":"s26","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 10","default":"A new site typically has no fixed line and patchy mobile signal, yet needs drawings, variations and photographs moving the same day. Temporary connectivity, cellular failover and offline-tolerant working matter more here than raw office bandwidth."},{"k":"s27","type":"s","label":"List item 14","default":"02"},{"k":"s28","type":"s","label":"Heading 5","default":"Drawings are large, versioned, and expensive to get wrong"},{"k":"s29","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 11","default":"Design files are big and change often, and building from a superseded revision is a costly mistake. The technology question is controlled access to the current version from a site device, which is a synchronisation and permissions problem rather than a storage one."},{"k":"s30","type":"s","label":"List item 15","default":"03"},{"k":"s31","type":"s","label":"Heading 6","default":"Kit that lives in a van and a dusty cabin"},{"k":"s32","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 12","default":"Site hardware is dropped, rained on and occasionally stolen. Device encryption, remote wipe and a fast replacement path are worth more than specification, because the realistic failure mode is loss rather than obsolescence."},{"k":"s33","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 13","default":"04"},{"k":"s34","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 14","default":"Customer stories"},{"k":"s35","type":"s","label":"Heading 7","default":"What our clients say"},{"k":"i36","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<picture>\n      <source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-480.avif 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-768.avif 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-1024.avif 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-1280.avif 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 300px, 100vw\">\n      <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-480.webp 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-768.webp 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 300px, 100vw\">\n      <img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-1280.webp\" alt=\"Network engineer patching a cabinet in a server rack\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    </picture>","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/network-engineer-patching-rack-1280.webp"}},{"k":"s37","type":"s","label":"Text 1","default":"Case study · Construction"},{"k":"u38","type":"u","label":"Link: GH Building & Landscaping","default":"/our-customers/gh-building-and-landscaping/"},{"k":"s39","type":"s","label":"Link text 1","default":"GH Building & Landscaping"},{"k":"s40","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 15","default":"Reliable, phone-first support for a construction business that needs answers on site, not ticket numbers."},{"k":"s41","type":"s","label":"Text 2","default":"Read the story"},{"k":"s42","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 16","default":"WhizzIT are always on hand to support my construction company. Being able to simply pick up the phone and receive great IT support is an essential part of running my business."},{"k":"s43","type":"s","label":"Caption 1","default":"GH"},{"k":"s44","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Gary Hufford"},{"k":"s45","type":"s","label":"Caption 2","default":"Owner, GH Building & Landscaping"},{"k":"u46","type":"u","label":"Link: See all 15 reviews","default":"https://www.google.com/maps?cid=17055157413191665489"},{"k":"s47","type":"s","label":"Link text 2","default":"See all 15 reviews"},{"k":"s48","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 17","default":"05"},{"k":"s49","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 18","default":"What we do"},{"k":"s50","type":"s","label":"Heading 8","default":"Everything IT, under one roof"},{"k":"s51","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 19","default":"From day-to-day support to cyber security and full projects, we take care of the technology 